{"4247450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zero Station: Interval", "steam_appid": 4247450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the staff. You are the newest employee of the 'Interval'—an interdimensional subway system situated at the crossroads of existence. Armed with a ritual spear, you must navigate bureaucratic madness and venture into unstable realms to eliminate anomalies that shouldn't exist. Uncover the cause of the cosmic system failure before the void claims you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR FIRST SHIFT IN THE VOID</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up within the walls of a monumental institution known as the Interdimensional Metro. Here, concrete halls are infinite, and the laws of physics are replaced by strict bureaucracy. You’ve signed the contract. You are no longer just a survivor; you are an <strong>Employee</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALITY’S SOURCE CODE IS CORRUPTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Metro connects worlds, but something has gone wrong. &quot;Objects&quot;—entities and items that do not belong—have leaked into stable realities. They distort space, defy logic, and threaten the balance of the multiverse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify and Eliminate:</strong> Your task is to locate the &quot;foreign elements&quot; and restore the reality's integrity by any means necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tool of Order:</strong> Your mystical spear is the only instrument capable of interacting with unstable matter and neutralizing rogue anomalies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRETS BETWEEN STATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Metro is in no hurry to reveal its secrets. Why have the realities begun to collapse? Who truly operates the &quot;Interval&quot;? Journey through 6 unique worlds—from majestic brutalist structures to nightmarish dark voids—to reach the source of the instability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Brutalism:</strong> Experience the crushing power of architecture in <strong>UE5</strong>. Lumen and Nanite technologies create a world that feels as cold as wet concrete and as unsettling as a fever dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere of Unpredictability:</strong> In worlds where everything has &quot;gone wrong,&quot; even a simple station bench can become a lethal threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; Mystery:</strong> Piece together the history of the Metro through environmental storytelling and cryptic bureaucratic reports.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting-Edge Performance:</strong> Full support for <strong>DLSS 4.5</strong> and <strong>XeSS 3.0.1</strong> ensures smooth gameplay and ultra-sharp visuals on modern hardware. <i>Note: A DXR (Ray Tracing) compatible graphics card is strictly required to run the game.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the staff. You are the newest employee of the 'Interval'—an interdimensional subway system situated at the crossroads of existence. Armed with a ritual spear, you must navigate bureaucratic madness and venture into unstable realms to eliminate anomalies that shouldn't exist. Uncover the cause of the cosmic system failure before the void claims you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR FIRST SHIFT IN THE VOID</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up within the walls of a monumental institution known as the Interdimensional Metro. Here, concrete halls are infinite, and the laws of physics are replaced by strict bureaucracy. You’ve signed the contract. You are no longer just a survivor; you are an <strong>Employee</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALITY’S SOURCE CODE IS CORRUPTED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Metro connects worlds, but something has gone wrong. &quot;Objects&quot;—entities and items that do not belong—have leaked into stable realities. They distort space, defy logic, and threaten the balance of the multiverse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Identify and Eliminate:</strong> Your task is to locate the &quot;foreign elements&quot; and restore the reality's integrity by any means necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Tool of Order:</strong> Your mystical spear is the only instrument capable of interacting with unstable matter and neutralizing rogue anomalies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SECRETS BETWEEN STATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the Metro is in no hurry to reveal its secrets. Why have the realities begun to collapse? Who truly operates the &quot;Interval&quot;? Journey through 6 unique worlds—from majestic brutalist structures to nightmarish dark voids—to reach the source of the instability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surreal Brutalism:</strong> Experience the crushing power of architecture in <strong>UE5</strong>. Lumen and Nanite technologies create a world that feels as cold as wet concrete and as unsettling as a fever dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere of Unpredictability:</strong> In worlds where everything has &quot;gone wrong,&quot; even a simple station bench can become a lethal threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Lore &amp; Mystery:</strong> Piece together the history of the Metro through environmental storytelling and cryptic bureaucratic reports.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cutting-Edge Performance:</strong> Full support for <strong>DLSS 4.5</strong> and <strong>XeSS 3.0.1</strong> ensures smooth gameplay and ultra-sharp visuals on modern hardware. <i>Note: A DXR (Ray Tracing) compatible graphics card is strictly required to run the game.</i></p>", "short_description": "New employee wanted. Join the &quot;Interval&quot;—an interdimensional subway system. Armed with a ritual spear, navigate bureaucratic madness and eliminate anomalies threatening the multiverse. Uncover the cause of the system failure before the void claims you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247450/dd9725862b6f55d91d01522feb6faa376907965a/header.jpg?t=1787384711", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247450/49952a82253eec7fad3d961a79e2c0f628555158/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787384711", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4247450/49952a82253eec7fad3d961a79e2c0f628555158/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787384711", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I7 6700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3050 6 gb<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DXR-compatible video card with DLSS/XeSS support is recommended for the best visual experience.</